      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Weigh or measure the yarn every 5 rows to check progress against the remaining amount. Stop when you have about 15 cm of yarn left for the finishing tail. Total yarn needed is around 190 m of DK cotton."
          }
        ]
      },
